# Loaded ONLY by `vite build --mode preview` (the preview:auth script), never by
# a default `vite build`. That is what makes it safe to commit: the production
# image builds in production mode and never reads this file.
#
# `vite preview` serves the built bundle from localhost, which hits the same
# wall as the dev server — the deployed Directus refuses every browser call
# from a localhost origin, anonymous reads included. Baking the relative base
# here lets the preview server's own /directus proxy answer them.
# See the localProxy comment in vite.config.ts for why a proxy and not an
# allow-list entry.
VITE_DIRECTUS_URL=/directus
